@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title 2PC: щасливий шлях (усі сказали «так»)

participant "Координатор" as TM
participant "payment" as P
participant "inventory" as I
participant "order" as O

== Фаза 1: голосування ==
TM -> P : Prepare
TM -> I : Prepare
